  "slug": "window-story",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/2067_window-story.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "For years, a woman thought her neighbor was lazy. “That woman never gets her clothes clean. Look at the clothes she hangs outside—they always have dirt on them. I really don’t know why she doesn’t wash them better.”",
    "One day, a friend came to her house and realized that the neighbor’s clothes weren’t dirty at all. It was her own window that was dirty. After wiping the dirt off the window, the friend said, “See? Isn’t that much cleaner?”"
  ],
  "english_full": "For years, a woman thought her neighbor was lazy. “That woman never gets her clothes clean. Look at the clothes she hangs outside—they always have dirt on them. I really don’t know why she doesn’t wash them better.”\n\nOne day, a friend came to her house and realized that the neighbor’s clothes weren’t dirty at all. It was her own window that was dirty. After wiping the dirt off the window, the friend said, “See? Isn’t that much cleaner?”",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "На́протя́жении многи́х ле́т одна же́нщина ду́мала, что её сосе́дка - лени́вая. «Эта же́нщина никогда́ не мо́ет свою́ оде́жду. Посмотри́ на оде́жду, которую она ви́сит на́ ulicе́ — на ней всегда́ грязь. Я и́скренне не зна́ю, почему́ она не мо́ет её лу́чше.»",
    "Одна́жды к ней пришёл друг и осозна́л, что оде́жда сосе́дки совсем не гря́зная. Это её собственное окно́ было гря́зным. По́сле того как он вы́тер грязь с окна́, друг ска́зал: «Смотри́? Разве́ не чи́стo? »"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Náprotyazhenii mnógikh lét odna zhenshchina dumala, chto ee sosédka - lenivýa. «Eta zhenshchina nikogdá ne móet svóiu odézhdu. Posmotrí na odézhdu, kotoruiu ona vísit ná ulitsé — na neí vsegdá grýaz'. Ia ískrenne ne znáiu, pochemú ona ne móet ee luchshe.»",
    "Odnázhdy k neí prishél drug i osoznal, chto odézhda sosédki sovsem ne grýaznaia. Eto ee sobstvennoe oknó bylo grýaznym. Poslé togo kak on výter grýaz' s okná, drug skázal: «Smotrí? Razvé ne chísto? »"
  ],
