  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "story_2067_p0_c0",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "На́протя́жении многи́х ле́т одна же́нщина ду́мала, что её сосе́дка - лени́вая.",
      "text_en": "For years, a woman thought her neighbor was lazy.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Náprotyázhenii\" data-defn=\"напротяжении\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">На́протя́жении</span><rt>Náprotyázhenii</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mnogíkh\" data-defn=\"многих\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">многи́х</span><rt>mnogíkh</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lét\" data-defn=\"лет\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ле́т</span><rt>lét</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"odna\" data-defn=\"одна\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">одна</span><rt>odna</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhénshchina\" data-defn=\"женщина\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">же́нщина</span><rt>zhénshchina</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dúmala\" data-defn=\"думала\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ду́мала</span><rt>dúmala</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chto\" data-defn=\"что\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">что</span><rt>chto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"eyo\" data-defn=\"её\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">её</span><rt>eyo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sosédka\" data-defn=\"соседка\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">сосе́дка</span><rt>sosédka</rt></ruby> - <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lenívaya\" data-defn=\"ленивая\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">лени́вая</span><rt>lenívaya</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Náprotyázhenii mnogíkh lét odna zhénshchina dúmala, chto eyo sosédka - lenívaya.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.2,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2067_p0_c1",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "«Эта же́нщина никогда́ не мо́ет свою́ оде́жду.",
      "text_en": "“That woman never gets her clothes clean.",
      "ruby": "«<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Eta\" data-defn=\"эта\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Эта</span><rt>Eta</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhénshchina\" data-defn=\"женщина\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">же́нщина</span><rt>zhénshchina</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nikogdá\" data-defn=\"никогда\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">никогда́</span><rt>nikogdá</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"не\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">не</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"móet\" data-defn=\"моет\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">мо́ет</span><rt>móet</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"svoyú\" data-defn=\"свою\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">свою́</span><rt>svoyú</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"odézhdu\" data-defn=\"одежду\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">оде́жду</span><rt>odézhdu</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "«Eta zhénshchina nikogdá ne móet svoyú odézhdu.",
      "start": 4.55,
      "end": 6.91,
      "duration": 2.36
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2067_p0_c2",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "Посмотри́ на оде́жду, которую она ви́сит на́ ulicе́ — на ней всегда́ грязь.",
      "text_en": "Look at the clothes she hangs outside—they always have dirt on them.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Posmotrí\" data-defn=\"посмотри\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Посмотри́</span><rt>Posmotrí</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"na\" data-defn=\"на\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">на</span><rt>na</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"odézhdu\" data-defn=\"одежду\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">оде́жду</span><rt>odézhdu</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kotoruyu\" data-defn=\"которую\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">которую</span><rt>kotoruyu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ona\" data-defn=\"она\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">она</span><rt>ona</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"vísit\" data-defn=\"висит\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ви́сит</span><rt>vísit</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ná\" data-defn=\"на\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">на́</span><rt>ná</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ulicé\" data-defn=\"ulicе\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ulicе́</span><rt>ulicé</rt></ruby> — <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"na\" data-defn=\"на\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">на</span><rt>na</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ney\" data-defn=\"ней\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ней</span><rt>ney</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"vsegdá\" data-defn=\"всегда\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">всегда́</span><rt>vsegdá</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gryaz&#x27;\" data-defn=\"грязь\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">грязь</span><rt>gryaz&#x27;</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Posmotrí na odézhdu, kotoruyu ona vísit ná ulicé — na ney vsegdá gryaz'.",
      "start": 7.26,
      "end": 11.27,
      "duration": 4.01
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2067_p0_c3",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "Я и́скренне не зна́ю, почему́ она не мо́ет её лу́чше.»",
      "text_en": "I really don’t know why she doesn’t wash them better.”",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Я</span><rt>Ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ískrenne\" data-defn=\"искренне\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">и́скренне</span><rt>ískrenne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"не\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">не</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"znáyu\" data-defn=\"знаю\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">зна́ю</span><rt>znáyu</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pochemú\" data-defn=\"почему\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">почему́</span><rt>pochemú</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ona\" data-defn=\"она\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">она</span><rt>ona</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"не\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">не</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"móet\" data-defn=\"моет\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">мо́ет</span><rt>móet</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"eyo\" data-defn=\"её\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">её</span><rt>eyo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lúchshe\" data-defn=\"лучше\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">лу́чше</span><rt>lúchshe</rt></ruby>.»",
      "transliteration": "Ya ískrenne ne znáyu, pochemú ona ne móet eyo lúchshe.»",
      "start": 11.62,
      "end": 14.72,
      "duration": 3.1
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2067_p1_c0",
      "chunk_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "Одна́жды к ней пришёл друг и осозна́л, что оде́жда сосе́дки совсем не гря́зная.",
      "text_en": "One day, a friend came to her house and realized that the neighbor’s clothes weren’t dirty at all.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Odnázhdy\" data-defn=\"однажды\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Одна́жды</span><rt>Odnázhdy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"k\" data-defn=\"к\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">к</span><rt>k</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ney\" data-defn=\"ней\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ней</span><rt>ney</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"prishyol\" data-defn=\"пришёл\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">пришёл</span><rt>prishyol</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"drug\" data-defn=\"друг\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">друг</span><rt>drug</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"i\" data-defn=\"и\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">и</span><rt>i</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"osoznál\" data-defn=\"осознал\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">осозна́л</span><rt>osoznál</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chto\" data-defn=\"что\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">что</span><rt>chto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"odézhda\" data-defn=\"одежда\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">оде́жда</span><rt>odézhda</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sosédki\" data-defn=\"соседки\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">сосе́дки</span><rt>sosédki</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sovsem\" data-defn=\"совсем\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">совсем</span><rt>sovsem</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"не\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">не</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gryáznaya\" data-defn=\"грязная\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">гря́зная</span><rt>gryáznaya</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Odnázhdy k ney prishyol drug i osoznál, chto odézhda sosédki sovsem ne gryáznaya.",
      "start": 15.32,
      "end": 19.43,
      "duration": 4.11
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2067_p1_c1",
      "chunk_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Это её собственное окно́ было гря́зным.",
      "text_en": "It was her own window that was dirty.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Eto\" data-defn=\"это\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Это</span><rt>Eto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"eyo\" data-defn=\"её\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">её</span><rt>eyo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sobstvennoe\" data-defn=\"собственное\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">собственное</span><rt>sobstvennoe</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"oknó\" data-defn=\"окно\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">окно́</span><rt>oknó</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bylo\" data-defn=\"было\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">было</span><rt>bylo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gryáznym\" data-defn=\"грязным\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">гря́зным</span><rt>gryáznym</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Eto eyo sobstvennoe oknó bylo gryáznym.",
      "start": 19.78,
      "end": 22.03,
      "duration": 2.25
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2067_p1_c2",
      "chunk_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "По́сле того как он вы́тер грязь с окна́, друг ска́зал: «Смотри́?",
      "text_en": "After wiping the dirt off the window, the friend said, “See?",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Pósle\" data-defn=\"после\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">По́сле</span><rt>Pósle</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"togo\" data-defn=\"того\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">того</span><rt>togo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kak\" data-defn=\"как\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">как</span><rt>kak</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"on\" data-defn=\"он\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">он</span><rt>on</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"výter\" data-defn=\"вытер\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">вы́тер</span><rt>výter</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gryaz&#x27;\" data-defn=\"грязь\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">грязь</span><rt>gryaz&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"s\" data-defn=\"с\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">с</span><rt>s</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"okná\" data-defn=\"окна\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">окна́</span><rt>okná</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"drug\" data-defn=\"друг\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">друг</span><rt>drug</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"skázal\" data-defn=\"сказал\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ска́зал</span><rt>skázal</rt></ruby>: «<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Smotrí\" data-defn=\"смотри\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Смотри́</span><rt>Smotrí</rt></ruby>?",
      "transliteration": "Pósle togo kak on výter gryaz' s okná, drug skázal: «Smotrí?",
      "start": 22.38,
      "end": 26.15,
      "duration": 3.77
    },
    {
